<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Deutsche Bank.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Deutsche Bank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued one million American-style call warrants on ordinary shares of Deutsche Bank AG, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls two shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    85 DEM		    PREMIUM	8.01 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     11.09 DEM		 GEARING	15.12 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JAN.97-19.SEP.97   PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  83.83 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
